---
title: 同票投票で vote.final=final かつ vote.tiebreaker=draw のとき引き分け終局
setup: { werewolf: 1, villager: 2 }
rules:
  general.first-victim: none
  vote.final: final
  vote.tiebreaker: draw
---
# 3 人が 1票ずつ別の player に投票 → 3-way 同票 → 即 draw (revote なし)。

++Alice、Bob、Carol
!Alice=人狼
!Bob=村人
!Carol=村人

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Bob
Bob→Carol
Carol→Alice

# == engine: Final ==
# result: draw
# survivors: Alice, Bob, Carol
# == end ==

# @expect-result: draw
# @expect-finished: true
